     "Cross-engine gate") in the face of the typst template ({font}, Times New Roman) 14 pt (size 28 half points),
     Body Text in 28 pt line boxes with a half-inch indent, footnotes in 17 pt boxes, 7 pt after each, quotations 14 pt
     above and below, exact line spacing (typst pitch-double, pitch-single); plus the "CA ..." paragraph styles ca8.lua
     writes the cover, headings, tables, signature and certificates in: single-spaced (17 pt boxes), with the typst
     template's spaces (twips = 20 x pt); contents rows wrap before the 36 pt page column (typst toc-page-col),
     authorities before the 56 pt one (toa-page-col), a dot leader to a right tab at the 6.5 in text width. The page
     setup and the footers come from ca8.lua (FORMBOOK_FOOTERS, FORMBOOK_FINAL). -->
